            "run_id": "gen4-r1-s2-20260914162406-58f95c",
            "block_reason": "Scope refusal rests on two provably false premises: (1) the absolute authorisation-weakening prohibition matched the test FILENAME because the unanchored regex '#|auth|#' matches the substring 'auth' inside the word 'authority' (tools/ai-autonomy.php:945); (2) the absolute existing-test prohibition matched because isExistingTestPath() evaluates file_exists() after the run, so the file this run created is judged pre-existing. The work itself was verified independently: census akira 47/47, policy allowed_roles=admin granted in tenant 54, test 14/14 including a negative control. Harness not repaired: CD-41 freeze holds.",
