        },
        {
            "run_id": "p6c-sitemap-robots",
            "block_reason": "The module.json edit is authorised by this contract's Files likely affected and acceptance criterion 5. The L4 classification is the known D-2 defect: finish() has no flag to receive a justification, so any slice touching a module.json blocks unconditionally. The executor's deviation from capabilities.routes to governance.exemptions was accepted on measured grounds - anonymous dispatch fails unknown_role when actor_role is empty, so declaring a public route would 403 every crawler. Verified: sitemap 200 application/xml 15 loc, robots 200 text/plain, 39/0 and shell 116/0 unmodified.",
            "director_decision": "CD-56",
